    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>ACTA (Amicale du Chien de Travail d'Antibes) is a dog club based in the 3 Moulins zone in Antibes, offering dog training, obedience, agility and ring.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The club is listed by the Société Centrale Canine as an approved club (no. 2812), with a ground at the ZI des 3 Moulins, route des Alisiers, in Antibes. Federation directories list training, ring and agility. We did not find a website of its own or a phone number published by the club itself.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: contact the club before coming to find out session times, which often vary with the season.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Cap d'Antibes and its coastal paths are a few minutes away by car to extend your outing.</p>
